s across the company, IT systems, and consolidate our manufacturing network.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/icu-medical-icui-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ICUI 2025 Q3","e":"icui","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Michael Bonnell","x":"…of cash spend for quality system and product-related remediation activities, $13 million on restructuring and integration, and $29 million on CapEx for general maintenance and capacity expansion at our facilities as well as placement of revenue-generating infusion pumps with customers…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/icu-medical-icui-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ICUI 2026 Q1","e":"icui","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brian Bonnell","x":"In the first quarter, we recognized $10 million of tariff expense, which represents approximately 2% of adjusted revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/icu-medical-icui-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ICUI 2026 Q1","e":"icui","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Brian Bonnell","x":"And the second item is the increase in tariff expense of approximately $8 million year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/icu-medical-icui-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ICUI 2026 Q1","e":"icui","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Bonnell","x":"Restructuring, integration and strategic transaction expenses were $17 million in the first quarter and related primarily to our IT systems integration and manufacturing plant consolidation projects.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/icu-medical-icui-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ICUI 2026 Q1","e":"icui","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Bonnell","x":"…of cash spend for quality system and product-related remediation activities, $17 million on restructuring and 